Hi Scott,

thx for detailed response. seems to be a numerical one, as it currently
do

prob = inv.link(...)
and then uses log(prob) in the likelihood calculations

this unifies the code over various link-functions.

but if we merge these two steps for link=cloglog, and then do

log_prob = log.inv.link(...)

and spell this out spesifucally, the problem goes away.

let me check it a bit more...

H

